++## Canonical Data Model
++
++The shared prompt entity should support:
++
++- `id`
++- `title`
++- `description`
++- `content`
++- `system_prompt`
++- `negative_prompt`
++- `lane`: claude, gpt, gemini, oss, cross-lab
